DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
20603::$$$message_0165_0000_0000$$$::...Lastly, I'll stop by the church.::
20604::$$$message_0165_0001_0000$$$::I can't remember exactly how many times I've been here now.[lr]::
20605::$$$message_0165_0001_0001$$$::Here, the four-day rule doesn't apply. I can visit and leave as many times as I want.::
20606::$$$message_0165_0002_0000$$$::Still, I'll eventually run out of things to talk about with Caren.[lr]::
20607::$$$message_0165_0002_0001$$$::There's nothing new here. So, it's only natural that all of the events will be filled in eventually.::
20608::$$$message_0165_0003_0000$$$::I visit the church to fill in blanks.[lr]::
20609::$$$message_0165_0003_0001$$$::This will be the last time.[lr]::
20610::$$$message_0165_0003_0002$$$::There won't be much point to visiting after that.::
20611::$$$message_0165_0004_0000$$$::"...Phew."[lr]::
20612::$$$message_0165_0004_0001$$$::I'm not tired, but I'm lacking energy.[lr]::
20613::$$$message_0165_0004_0002$$$::What I need now isn't rest, but motivation.[lr]::
20614::$$$message_0165_0004_0003$$$::I'll try to put a spring in my step.::
20615::$$$message_0165_0005_0000$$$::...Her performance this time was short.[lr]::
20616::$$$message_0165_0005_0001$$$::I feel let down because I showed up expecting much more, but it energized me, so there's that.[lr]::
20617::$$$message_0165_0005_0002$$$::The hot tightness in my chest feels good.[lr]::
20618::$$$message_0165_0005_0003$$$::It's like how they say people need to get mad once in a while to stay healthy.::
20619::$$$message_0165_0006_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20620::$$$message_0165_0006_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
20621::$$$message_0165_0006_0002$$$::But there's nothing else for me after that.[lr]::
20622::$$$message_0165_0006_0003$$$::After finishing her organ piece, Caren's standing in front of me wordlessly, as always.[lr]::
20623::$$$message_0165_0006_0004$$$::Somehow, she looks like she's in a worse mood than before. She strikes a daunting figure, even.::
20624::$$$message_0165_0007_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20625::$$$message_0165_0007_0001$$$::The cloudy weather pairs well with this church.[lr]::
20626::$$$message_0165_0007_0002$$$::It's better suited to a gray pall that reminds one death is nearby, than oppressive sunlight that makes you feel alive.[lr]::
20627::$$$message_0165_0007_0003$$$::This church was built before the war. It has a storied history, even before one notes that it was heavily renovated for the Third Holy Grail War.[lr]::
20628::$$$message_0165_0007_0004$$$::The Holy Church dispatched a man named Risei Kotomine to oversee Fuyuki. They trusted his skills, and he was already familiar with the lay of the land.[lr]::
20629::$$$message_0165_0007_0005$$$::He was also the father of Caren's predecessor, Kirei Kotomine.[wm canskip=0][wdash canskip=0]::
20630::$$$message_0165_0008_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20631::$$$message_0165_0008_0001$$$::The young Risei was charged to oversee the Third Holy Grail War, and granted authority over the local church in recognition of his accomplishments.[lr]::
20632::$$$message_0165_0008_0002$$$::His experience also helped him manage the Fourth Holy Grail War effectively, but he died due to unforeseen troubles.[lr]::
20633::$$$message_0165_0008_0003$$$::The local mage he was backing also suffered a defeat, and the fourth war ended in chaos.::
20634::$$$message_0165_0009_0000$$$::It was the war that caused the great fire in Shinto.[lr]::
20635::$$$message_0165_0009_0001$$$::So, there was the third war fifty years ago, that was almost fought under wartime conditions, the fourth war that happened on the cusp of Fuyuki's modernization and economic boom,[lr]::
20636::$$$message_0165_0009_0002$$$::and the last Holy Grail War six months ago, which Shirou Emiya fought in.::
20637::$$$message_0165_0010_0000$$$::It's been two hundred years since it began.[lr]::
20638::$$$message_0165_0010_0001$$$::Honestly, it's a wonder that they've kept this sacrament going for so long in this far eastern land.[lr]::
20639::$$$message_0165_0010_0002$$$::They pursued a miracle with a fervor bordering on insanity.[lr]::
20640::$$$message_0165_0010_0003$$$::One might even say that the promise of the Holy Grail possessed both the Holy Church and the Mage's Association.[lr]::
20641::$$$message_0165_0010_0004$$$::Still, though...[lr]::
20642::$$$message_0165_0010_0005$$$::Was it really worth coming all this way?::
20643::$$$message_0165_0011_0000$$$::Anyway...[lr]::
20644::$$$message_0165_0011_0001$$$::"........."[lr]::
20645::$$$message_0165_0011_0002$$$::"All right, fine. Let's talk."::
20646::$$$message_0165_0012_0000$$$::"Beginning with you this time, if you don't mind. I have nothing to discuss.[lr]::
20647::$$$message_0165_0012_0001$$$::Our agreement is in effect after you finish."[lr]::
20648::$$$message_0165_0012_0002$$$::"Mrgh. I have to start, huh?"::
20649::$$$message_0165_0013_0000$$$::Just my luck. But I did lose the staring contest, so it falls to me to keep the conversation going.[lr]::
20650::$$$message_0165_0013_0001$$$::...Unfortunately, I'm out of stuff to talk about, too.[lr]::
20651::$$$message_0165_0013_0002$$$::I don't have any small talk that would suit her, and no more questions to ask.::
20652::$$$message_0165_0014_0000$$$::If there's something I want to know, it would be...[lr]::
20653::$$$message_0165_0014_0001$$$::"Oh, right."[lr]::
20654::$$$message_0165_0014_0002$$$::There actually is something I'm really curious about!::
20655::$$$message_0165_0015_0000$$$::"What?"[lr]::
20656::$$$message_0165_0015_0001$$$::"I just remembered, you changed your clothes.[lr]::
20657::$$$message_0165_0015_0002$$$::You weren't wearing your nun's habit at night."::
20658::$$$message_0165_0016_0000$$$::"Yes. What of it?"[lr]::
20659::$$$message_0165_0016_0001$$$::"Well, I was curious why you changed.[lr]::
20660::$$$message_0165_0016_0002$$$::Nuns don't wear stuff like that. Right now you're in full Sister Caren mode, but at night you didn't look like a holy woman at all."::
20661::$$$message_0165_0017_0000$$$::Quite the opposite, in fact.[lr]::
20662::$$$message_0165_0017_0001$$$::There's no way she got permission to wear it just because it's black like her cassock.::
20663::$$$message_0165_0018_0000$$$::"...Do you mean that I was too lightly dressed for my clerical station?"[lr]::
20664::$$$message_0165_0018_0001$$$::"No...more like you had a whole different vibe. Isn't that awfully bold? It was all black, like something a supervillain would wear. I wouldn't have gotten the wrong idea if you wore these clothes all the time."::
20665::$$$message_0165_0019_0000$$$::"...I wear them while exorcising demons.[lr]::
20666::$$$message_0165_0019_0001$$$::Isn't it obvious that combat attire would differ from my daily habit?"[lr]::
20667::$$$message_0165_0019_0002$$$::"Ah, so it's what you wear when you're fighting demons.[lr]::
20668::$$$message_0165_0019_0003$$$::Hmm... I guess it does look easy to move in. Though you're nearly naked."::
20669::$$$message_0165_0020_0000$$$::"...Do you have some personal opinion on my clothing?"::
20670::$$$message_0165_0021_0000$$$::"More like doubts than an opinion. You don't need to wear that just because it's easy to move in. It looks like it's someone's personal taste.[lr]::
20671::$$$message_0165_0021_0001$$$::Y'know, like...it's even wilder than a bad swimsuit. Overly suggestive, or, well, I'm not sure how to put this, but..."::
20672::$$$message_0165_0022_0000$$$::"...Did you forget to put on a bottom?"::
20673::$$$message_0165_0023_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20674::$$$message_0165_0023_0001$$$::She doesn't answer. Does that mean I'm right?::
20675::$$$message_0165_0024_0000$$$::"That's just how it was designed. It isn't meant to have a skirt. Please cease your lascivious fantasies."[lr]::
20676::$$$message_0165_0024_0001$$$::Oof. She read my mind.::
20677::$$$message_0165_0025_0000$$$::"Y-yeah, right. You're a sister, so you aren't allowed to seduce people. There's no way. [lr]::
20678::$$$message_0165_0025_0001$$$::Sorry, dumb question. I was just curious, but it can't possibly be clothes for fighting in.[lr]::
20679::$$$message_0165_0025_0002$$$::So...[wvl canskip=0 time=400]whose kink is that, exactly?"::
20680::$$$message_0165_0026_0000$$$::"It isn't a personal preference, either.[lr]::
20681::$$$message_0165_0026_0001$$$::I simply selected one of my ritual outfits and modified it."[lr]::
20682::$$$message_0165_0026_0002$$$::"Oh. Picked it yourself, did you?"::
20683::$$$message_0165_0027_0000$$$::"I prioritized mobility. Mobility over protection.[lr]::
20684::$$$message_0165_0027_0001$$$::And it would seem suggestive to you, I'd expect. It was designed to attract the male gaze."::
20685::$$$message_0165_0028_0000$$$::"Huh?"[lr]::
20686::$$$message_0165_0028_0001$$$::My eyes go wide.[lr]::
20687::$$$message_0165_0028_0002$$$::It's for seducing men? Is she serious right now!?::
20688::$$$message_0165_0029_0000$$$::"Wait, didn't you say that was against your religion's rules!?"[lr]::
20689::$$$message_0165_0029_0001$$$::"You're the one who said that. I never mentioned such a thing."[lr]::
20690::$$$message_0165_0029_0002$$$::"Urgh... B-but isn't it impious? People will think you forgot to put on a skirt."::
20691::$$$message_0165_0030_0000$$$::"Wearing clothes to entice men is different from stripping in public. [l][say storage=karen04_kar_0151 name=カレン]You seem to have mistaken me for some sort of exhibitionist."[lr]::
20692::$$$message_0165_0030_0001$$$::She sounds upset that I called her impious.[lr]::
20693::$$$message_0165_0030_0002$$$::Those sound the same from a male point of view, but I guess I overdid it by calling it exhibitionism. That's a crime, after all.::
20694::$$$message_0165_0031_0000$$$::"...So, why are you trying to seduce men?[lr]::
20695::$$$message_0165_0031_0001$$$::I thought sisters were supposed to be celibate. Are you trying to reel in any man you see?"::
20696::$$$message_0165_0032_0000$$$::"I wouldn't deny such a man, if he wished it.[lr]::
20697::$$$message_0165_0032_0001$$$::For instance...if you craved a woman's bare skin, I would indulge you.[lr]::
20698::$$$message_0165_0032_0002$$$::This too, is part of my labors.[lr]::
20699::$$$message_0165_0032_0003$$$::My body always responds to pain. You would not be punished for it.[lr]::
20700::$$$message_0165_0032_0004$$$::It is not you that would tear into me, but a demon. As a human, you need not bear that sin."::
20701::$$$message_0165_0033_0000$$$::I see.[lr]::
20702::$$$message_0165_0033_0001$$$::Come to think of it, she doesn't even need to try to get tainted by demons.[lr]::
20703::$$$message_0165_0033_0002$$$::No one even needs to get their hands dirty for things to get pretty wild.[lr]::
20704::$$$message_0165_0033_0003$$$::It's like self-mutilation, but different.[lr]::
20705::$$$message_0165_0033_0004$$$::If that's how she's always lived, then it doesn't matter who does it.::
20706::$$$message_0165_0034_0000$$$::"Wow. So it's the same as daily prayer, to you.[lr]::
20707::$$$message_0165_0034_0001$$$::...Didn't expect that. So you've been seducing me this whole time?"::
20708::$$$message_0165_0035_0000$$$::"Yes, if that's what you want."[lr]::
20709::$$$message_0165_0035_0001$$$::"For real!? Nice![wvl canskip=0 time=1000] I never asked you to, though, so I'm good!"::
20710::$$$message_0165_0036_0000$$$::I sure am glad I got through this without embarrassing the girl.[lr]::
20711::$$$message_0165_0036_0001$$$::I'll never be in the mood to, no matter what she says. Thanks, but no thanks.[lr]::
20712::$$$message_0165_0036_0002$$$::Still, there's no problem as long as it depends entirely on my own will.::
20713::$$$message_0165_0037_0000$$$::"...And what is that supposed to mean? Do you prefer pure, innocent women?"[lr]::
20714::$$$message_0165_0037_0001$$$::"Nah, I don't care about that.[lr]::
20715::$$$message_0165_0037_0002$$$::If she's doing it 24/7 because that's what she likes, who cares about moral decency? I know you people like to say 'love thy neighbor,' and all that."::
20716::$$$message_0165_0038_0000$$$::"Th-that is [font italic=true]not[font italic=false] what my work entails.[lr]::
20717::$$$message_0165_0038_0001$$$::I am performing honest, unambiguous acts of labor."::
20718::$$$message_0165_0039_0000$$$::"How very virtuous of you.[lr]::
20719::$$$message_0165_0039_0001$$$::An equivalent exchange at the right price, and a relationship based on that isn't so bad. It's much better than a high-and-mighty woman who offers nothing."[lr]::
20720::$$$message_0165_0039_0002$$$::I glance around the chapel.[lr]::
20721::$$$message_0165_0039_0003$$$::There aren't any statues here. Doesn't look like I'll get in trouble for blasphemy.::
20722::$$$message_0165_0040_0000$$$::"Get it? Even if that was your day job, I wouldn't turn you down just because of that.[lr]::
20723::$$$message_0165_0040_0001$$$::I'm talking about the mental, not the physical. I am saying no because there's passion but no love."::
20724::$$$message_0165_0041_0000$$$::Though I can't guarantee what might happen if she were to prowl in front of me looking like [font italic=true]that[font italic=false].[lr]::
20725::$$$message_0165_0041_0001$$$::I can't speak for the tastes of a proper, mature man, but that outfit tests my restraint.::
20726::$$$message_0165_0042_0000$$$::"...I understand how you think now.[cacheimage storage=カレン修道服無帽01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=カレン修道服無帽01c(中)] I'll keep it in mind going forward."[lr]::
20727::$$$message_0165_0042_0001$$$::"Oh, are we done talking about clothes?"::
20728::$$$message_0165_0043_0000$$$::"Yes. I've had quite enough. I've learned more about you than I wanted to know."::
20729::$$$message_0165_0044_0000$$$::"...You really are weakened.[lr]::
20730::$$$message_0165_0044_0001$$$::You look so feeble that I could blow you away with a breath. Do you despise yourself that much?"::
20731::$$$message_0165_0045_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
20732::$$$message_0165_0045_0001$$$::The blatant provocation excites me even more.[lr]::
20733::$$$message_0165_0045_0002$$$::What the hell do you think you see in me with those useless eyes?[wdash canskip=0]::
20734::$$$message_0165_0046_0000$$$::"Why do you say that? I don't really dislike myself. If you're just going to lecture me, you can take that and stuff it."[lr]::
20735::$$$message_0165_0046_0001$$$::"I'm just expressing my thanks for complimenting my outfit. Have some grace and accept it.[lr]::
20736::$$$message_0165_0046_0002$$$::...So, why do you dislike me?"::
20737::$$$message_0165_0047_0000$$$::She jumps to a conclusion.[lr]::
20738::$$$message_0165_0047_0001$$$::I blurt out an answer before I can stop myself.[lr]::
20739::$$$message_0165_0047_0002$$$::"People who don't have any desires of their own rub me the wrong way."[lr]::
20740::$$$message_0165_0047_0003$$$::If I'm splitting hairs, there's actually a lot about her that bothers me, but I state the most critical reason.::
20741::$$$message_0165_0048_0000$$$::"See? That's why you dislike yourself.[lr]::
20742::$$$message_0165_0048_0001$$$::The Shirou Emiya who destroyed the Holy Grail had no desires of his own.[lr]::
20743::$$$message_0165_0048_0002$$$::He lived as a paragon of self-sacrifice who prayed for a just and righteous world, never once doubting himself."::
20744::$$$message_0165_0049_0000$$$::"So why, I wonder...[lr]::
20745::$$$message_0165_0049_0001$$$::Why don't you find such values beautiful?"::
20746::$$$message_0165_0050_0000$$$::"Well, you know[line len=2]"[lr]::
20747::$$$message_0165_0050_0001$$$::There's nothing beautiful about it.[lr]::
20748::$$$message_0165_0050_0002$$$::It's even more fundamental than judging good or evil.[lr]::
20749::$$$message_0165_0050_0003$$$::I'd never even consider trying to live such a pathetic life.::
20750::$$$message_0165_0051_0000$$$::"No one criticizes Shirou Emiya anymore, but he still has no desires of his own.[lr]::
20751::$$$message_0165_0051_0001$$$::Tell me...is it so boring to live a modest, happy life?"::
20752::$$$message_0165_0052_0000$$$::Oh...I see now.[lr]::
20753::$$$message_0165_0052_0001$$$::I live like someone who doesn't have that kind of patience at all.[lr]::
20754::$$$message_0165_0052_0002$$$::Wishing for enough happiness for just one life?[lr]::
20755::$$$message_0165_0052_0003$$$::A part of me screams that such a tiny bit of joy isn't worth it at all.::
20756::$$$message_0165_0053_0000$$$::"...You're good at word games.[lr]::
20757::$$$message_0165_0053_0001$$$::Impressive, Acting Prelate. That was a rock-solid comeback. Feel free to give me a real tongue-lashing, if you ever get the chance."::
20758::$$$message_0165_0054_0000$$$::"I doubt that one remark from me would be enough to alter your decade-old righteousness. If you like, however, I'd be happy to admonish you again."[wvs][clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=400]::
20759::$$$message_0165_0055_0000$$$::I get up.[lr]::
20760::$$$message_0165_0055_0001$$$::I should've left as soon as she finished playing the organ.[lr]::
20761::$$$message_0165_0055_0002$$$::What I wanted was energizing hatred.[lr]::
20762::$$$message_0165_0055_0003$$$::By the time I realized the repugnance was directed at me, I'd lost my precious motivation.::
20763::$$$message_0165_0056_0000$$$::"Bye. I've got better things to do, so our time here is over."[lr]::
20764::$$$message_0165_0056_0001$$$::I'll overstep my territory if I dig any deeper.[lr]::
20765::$$$message_0165_0056_0002$$$::If someone is reenacting the Holy Grail War over these four days, then Shirou Emiya can't keep meeting Caren Hortensia.[lr]::
20766::$$$message_0165_0056_0003$$$::His very state of being will collapse if he keeps meeting someone who didn't exist in the war.::
20767::$$$message_0165_0057_0000$$$::"You're going to seek the Holy Grail.[lr]::
20768::$$$message_0165_0057_0001$$$::Have you realized how to put an end to this world?"[lr]::
20769::$$$message_0165_0057_0002$$$::I hear a voice behind me, but turning around is too much trouble.::
20770::$$$message_0165_0058_0000$$$::"You tell me. According to Rin Tohsaka, I just need to defeat whoever holds the Grail."[lr]::
20771::$$$message_0165_0058_0001$$$::Based on all the evidence so far, I'll be defeated no matter how many times I repeat this cycle.::
20772::$$$message_0165_0059_0000$$$::"Yes, I suppose. That is why you need to complete this tapestry.[lr]::
20773::$$$message_0165_0059_0001$$$::...You must find your own meaning."[lr]::
20774::$$$message_0165_0059_0002$$$::By 'meaning,' she means self-awareness. An awareness of what I need to do.[lr]::
20775::$$$message_0165_0059_0003$$$::She's telling me that I need to find it on my own, rather than hear it from someone else.::
20776::$$$message_0165_0060_0000$$$::"Find the enemy's base of operations. It should contain the key to how this all began."[lr]::
20777::$$$message_0165_0060_0001$$$::"If you're talking about the mansions, I already looked a long time ago."[lr]::
20778::$$$message_0165_0060_0002$$$::"You might have overlooked something. Mention London to the Tohsaka heir."::
20779::$$$message_0165_0061_0000$$$::That's the most specific advice she's ever given me.[lr]::
20780::$$$message_0165_0061_0001$$$::On my way out, I reluctantly stop and turn.[lr]::
20781::$$$message_0165_0061_0002$$$::See? This why I didn't want to look back at her.::
20782::$$$message_0165_0062_0000$$$::"You broke our contract. I thought you said we'd only trade information."[lr]::
20783::$$$message_0165_0062_0001$$$::"This is a special case.[lr]::
20784::$$$message_0165_0062_0002$$$::I did also say that the next time you came, I would guide you if you were lost."::
20785::$$$message_0165_0063_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
20786::$$$message_0165_0063_0001$$$::Did she add that part herself?[lr]::
20787::$$$message_0165_0063_0002$$$::Seriously, this girl always does whatever she pleases.::
20788::$$$message_0165_0064_0000$$$::"Thanks. Now I'm really finished with you."[lr]::
20789::$$$message_0165_0064_0001$$$::"Yes. This is the most I can involve myself with Shirou Emiya."::
20790::$$$message_0165_0065_0000$$$::I leave the church.[lr]::
20791::$$$message_0165_0065_0001$$$::From the beginning, Shirou Emiya has never met Caren Hortensia.[lr]::
20792::$$$message_0165_0065_0002$$$::It isn't possible.[lr]::
20793::$$$message_0165_0065_0003$$$::So even if I never see her again, there's nothing to be sad about.::
920622::$$$message_9165_0006_0003$$$::After finishing her organ piece, Caren's standing in front of me wordlessly, as always.[r]::Xg